" href="#">Verified</a></div><span class="tby"><b>Emma L.,</b> 1 week ago</span><h4>Gift for my sister</h4><p>Wrapped beautifully with a handwritten card.</p></div></div><div class="tctl"><div class="tarr"><button type="button" class="tprev" aria-label="Previous reviews"><svg viewBox="0 0 8 12"><path d="M7 1L2 6l5 5"/></svg></button><button type="button" class="tnext" aria-label="More reviews"><svg viewBox="0 0 8 12"><path d="M1 1l5 5-5 5"/></svg></button></div></div></div></div>
